ull,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"id":6063,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Cobra","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk51/shows/593701f3-c9cb-4a16-a627-032c6221a347.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk59/shows/0ee33252-60b5-4901-b287-8f3355ab86d8.jpg","likes":47,"dislikes":1,"views":12628,"release_date":"517190400000","length":5224,"description":"A gang of neo-fascist thugs, led by the self-proclaimed 'Night Slasher', are breaking into people's homes & cars, then killing them at random. When of of these thugs holds up a food store & takes hostages, Lt. Marian Cobretti - an intense, take-no-prisoners cop, is brought onto the scene to end the hostage-taking. Ranting bizarrely about a 'New World', the man levels a sawed-off shotgun at Cobretti, who hits him with a knife, then guns him down when the man refuses to put down his weapon. Later that night, another murder occurs, attributed to the Night Slasher - and the next day, another one. This one is witnessed by a young woman, Ingrid Knutsen. She drives away before the thugs can kill her, but it isn't long before some creepy-looking people start making attempts on her life - and Cobretti's. Cobretti plans to move the only witness to the blood spree upstate, but with inside information, the thugs follow them. And a battle for survival rages between Cobretti and the thugs...","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":5.7}],"value":5.7,"age":"R"},"episode_id":6063,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}